able for guests and staff.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How does a farmhouse interior designer choose materials?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">We pick natural, durable materials such as stone, solid wood and terracotta that handle heat, dust and heavy use.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Weekend Retreat Close to Home</h2>\n            <p>A farmhouse should be a place your family wants to visit, not one that needs repairs every time you arrive. Planning it with an experienced farmhouse interior designer keeps upkeep low and weekends easy.</p><p>Own a farm on GT Karnal Road? <a href=\"/pitampura/contact\">Ask 9th Corner to visit the property</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}